| --- | --- | --- |
| $0$ | $\varnothing$ | $D,E$ |
| $3$ | $\{1\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $5$ | $\{2\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $8$ | $\{3\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $11$ | $\{1,3\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $13$ | $\{4\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $16$ | $\{1,4\}$ | $D,E$ |
| $18$ | $\{2,4\}$ | $D,E$ |
